{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12105080","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12105080","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1210508001:1":{"text":"이봐, 화를 내는 건 그렇다 쳐도 나는 왜 묶는 거야.","source_cn":"喂，生气就生气，怎么还把我捆上了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C94BB170AECDB91","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1210508002:1":{"text":"당신이 또 나쁜 짓을 할지도 모르니까요.","source_cn":"为了防止你再使坏。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F2513ABC152071D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1210508003:1":{"text":"당신은 소중한 우리의 믿음을 잃었으니까요!","source_cn":"因为你已经失去了我们宝贵的信任！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A58E6C93B1CF220","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1210508003":{"text":"당신은 소중한 우리의 믿음을 잃었으니까요!","source_cn":"因为你已经失去了我们宝贵的信任！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A58E6C93B1CF220","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1210508004:1":{"text":"아, 이런... 그래, 자업자득이니까. 그래도 싸지.","source_cn":"啊，这……好吧，我自作自受，活该。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8CF23322DF8578A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"s